      "message": "I am not sure I understand why we want to stop poll functions when we hit the first pending status.\n\nIf we still want to stop when we hit the first pending status, an optional nit: use `std::find_first_of` + `(*it)() \u003d\u003d DeviceOpStatus::kPending` so that later if we want to change `mPollFunctions` to `std::vector`, the code won\u0027t break because of error-prone iterator invalidation.",
