      "writtenOn": "2024-04-23T18:09:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We must call `vkDeviceWaitIdle` here, as now we allow the caller to even call `vkDestroyDevice` before the semaphore is signaled.\n\nWe don\u0027t need to call `vkDeviceWaitIdle` for pooled external fences and normal `VkFence`\u0027s because they associate with an actual guest payload, and the spec(our assumption) doesn\u0027t allow the caller to call `vkDestroyDevice` before the guest payload actually completes. This is different from the swapchain acquire semaphore, which doesn\u0027t associate with any guest payload.",
      "revId": "ce6b85a467c71a0d46e67d64bbc0d76a2f74da03",
